- **`template/src/main.cpp`**: a thin `main()` that passes the arguments to `{{NAME_SNAKE}}::run`.
- **`template/tests/{{NAME_SNAKE}}_test.cpp`**: GoogleTest tests of the placeholder line, `--help` and `-h`, `--version`, an unknown option (exits 2 with the usage on stderr), an unexpected argument, and a non-empty version. The helper is called `RunProgram`, not `Run`.
