Choices of mine you might not expect:

- **Version check:** the smoke test accepts any `{{NAME}} X.Y.Z` rather than exactly `0.1.0`, so raising the project version doesn't break it.
- **Extra arguments:** any argument that isn't an option (not just unknown options) also prints the usage and exits 2.
- **Include guard:** it is `{{NAME_SNAKE}}_{{NAME_SNAKE}}_HPP`, because the header sits at `{{NAME_SNAKE}}/{{NAME_SNAKE}}.hpp`.

